## 🔥 1. The Critical Battlefield: TVK Dominance (150 Booths)

### 📌 Overview
- Covers **~47% of total booths**
- Represents the **largest and most influential cluster**

### 📊 Vote Share
| Party   | Vote % |
|--------|--------|
| TVK    | 39.6%  |
| DMK    | 28.4%  |
| AIADMK | 26.0%  |

### 🔍 Insight
TVK has established a **clear lead**, consolidating anti-incumbency and youth votes.  
This acts as the **primary growth engine** for TVK.

### 🎯 Strategic Actions
- **TVK:** Strengthen grassroots presence and retain voter momentum  
- **DMK & AIADMK:** Avoid vote split; focus on reclaiming TVK voters  

