## ⚡ 4. Fragmented / DMK-Leaning Swing Zone (62 Booths)

### 📌 Overview
- **Highly competitive multi-party battleground**
- No clear dominant player

### 📊 Vote Share
| Party   | Vote % |
|--------|--------|
| DMK    | 36.4%  |
| TVK    | 27.0%  |
| AIADMK | 26.9%  |
| NTK    | 9.6%   |

### 🔍 Insight
- No party crosses **40% → True swing zone**
- Opposition vote is **split**
- **NTK acts as a decisive factor**

### 🎯 Strategic Actions
- **TVK & AIADMK:** Consolidate opposition + NTK votes  
- **DMK:** Prevent anti-incumbency consolidation  

---

## 🧠 Key Takeaways

- TVK relies on **broad but shallow dominance**
- DMK & AIADMK depend on **stronghold stability**
- **62 swing booths = election decider**
- **Vote splitting (NTK / Independents)** is critical

